From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Marek=20Ol=C5=A1=C3=A1k?= <maraeo@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:42:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] radv: fix to use HTILE fills instead of RMW shaders to
 restore previous behavior

This reverses the unintended behavior change in 6f36a2be.

This can fix https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/work_items/16288
only if there is a bug in the HTILE RMW dispatch.

Fixes: 6f36a2be "ac: unify HTILE codes and encoding"
(cherry picked from commit def8eef5fd9c04b388d75ac5de88f6bcf078cfd0)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45215>
(cherry picked from commit c4293329739d40c0520bdebe78cff8bc42ade79b)
---
 src/amd/vulkan/meta/radv_meta_clear.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/meta/radv_meta_clear.c b/src/amd/vulkan/meta/radv_meta_clear.c
index eabd625ef03..f8f68984676 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/meta/radv_meta_clear.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/meta/radv_meta_clear.c
@@ -658,7 +658,8 @@ radv_get_htile_mask(struct radv_cmd_buffer *cmd_buffer, const struct radv_image
          if (aspects & VK_IMAGE_ASPECT_DEPTH_BIT) {
             mask |= HTILE_ZS_CODE(.zmask = 0xF,
                                   .zdelta = 0x3F,
-                                  .zbase = 0x3FFF);
+                                  .zbase = 0x3FFF,
+                                  .unused = 0x3);
          }
          if (aspects & VK_IMAGE_ASPECT_STENCIL_BIT) {
             mask |= HTILE_ZS_CODE(.sr0 = 0x3,
